{
    "version": 3,
    "name": "Dot Pen",
    "group": "csp",
    "mn-engine": "dot",
    "comment": "Clip Studio Paint: ドットペン (Pen > Dot pen). Locked to 1 px with anti-aliasing off — one whole pixel per dab, no fringe, no pressure. For fine hatching and pixel-level cleanup, where a soft edge is the bug. Procedural (mn-engine), so it carries no libmypaint settings: a 0.5-radius .myb dab is a grey two-pixel ribbon, not a pixel."
}
